ligament, and this travels

65
00:03:18,830 --> 00:03:21,150
from the lateral
epicondyle to the annular

66
00:03:21,150 --> 00:03:24,690
ligament of the radial
head and radial notch. The

67
00:03:24,690 --> 00:03:27,410
