140
00:07:18,430 --> 00:07:20,870
dysfunction is that you'll
have a proximal ulna that

141
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:23,810
favors or prefers to
glide medially with distal

142
00:07:23,810 --> 00:07:27,970
forearm AB duction, and an AD
