253
00:13:58,680 --> 00:14:02,020
Now, one caveat is please
note that there can

254
00:14:02,020 --> 00:14:04,620
be a restriction of forearm
pronation or supination

255
00:14:04,620 --> 00:14:07,280
without restriction
