256
00:14:10,660 --> 00:14:13,900
Now a common mechanism
for a radial head somatic

257
00:14:13,900 --> 00:14:16,580
dysfunction is a fall
on an outstretched hand.

258
00:14:16,580 --> 00:14:20,100
The image to the left
shows a individual falling

259
00:14:20,100 --> 00:14:23,180
forward where the
