378
00:20:57,510 --> 00:21:01,030
for a radiocarpal joint
somatic dysfunction diagnosis.

379
00:21:02,870 --> 00:21:06,530
So let's finish things
off with connecting our

380
00:21:06,530 --> 00:21:09,270
radiocarpal or wrist
somatic dysfunctions to the

381
00:21:09,270 --> 00:21:11,650
