385
00:21:19,210 --> 00:21:21,210
right, and let's
start with letter A,

386
00:21:21,570 --> 00:21:23,770
we're talking
about ulno-humeral

387
00:21:23,770 --> 00:21:26,950
abduction somatic
dysfunction or radiocarpal

388
00:21:26,950 --> 00:21:28,710
