somatic dysfunction,

407
00:22:19,830 --> 00:22:22,370
and this will translate
to a preferred medial

408
00:22:22,370 --> 00:22:27,010
glide of the distal radius.
And so if you were to

409
00:22:27,010 --> 00:22:30,230
find a ulmohumeral adduction
somatic dysfunction,

410
00:22:30,230 --> 00:22:32,510
the likely radiocarpal
joint somatic dysfunction

411
00:22:32,510 --> 00:22:35,790
is an abduction somatic
dysfunction, or vice

412
00:22:35,790 --> 00:22:38,470
versa, where if you find
a radiocarpal abduction

